      "canonical_latex": "G(s) := \\frac{Y(s)}{U(s)} = \\frac{\\sum_{m=0}^{M} b_m s^m}{\\sum_{k=0}^{n} a_k s^k}\\quad \\big(y^{(k)}(0^-) = u^{(m)}(0^-) = 0\\big)",
